  "description": "Find the length of the diameter of an N-ary tree, defined as the longest path between any two nodes.",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "1. let maxDiameter = 0\n2. function dfs(node):\n3.   if !node return 0\n4.   let max1 = 0, max2 = 0\n5.   for child in node.children:\n6.     let depth = dfs(child)\n7.     if depth > max1: max2 = max1, max1 = depth\n8.     else if depth > max2: max2 = depth\n9.   maxDiameter = max(maxDiameter, max1 + max2)\n10.  return max1 + 1",
